{"id":"877f1061e295cf5f","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-functor.md","title":"Functor","display":"df-functor — Functor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-functor","aliases":["58-df-functor","Functor"],"display":"df-functor — Functor","depends_on":["[[58-df-category-theory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-functor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-functor</span><span>Functor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-functor — Functor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"58-df-category-theory\">58-df-category-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\\in V\">\\(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C\\rangle\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D\\rangle\\)</span> 的分量在下式中存在量化；复合以有序对为输入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\">\\(F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\)</span> 是对象映射与箭头映射的二元记录。非该记录形式的输入不满足本谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"58-df-category-theory\">58-df-category-theory</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}functor}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C,D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D,F_0,F_1\\;\\bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal D)\n\\land F_0\\in D_0^{C_0}\\land F_1\\in D_1^{C_1}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\bigl(s_D(F_1(f))=F_0(s_C(f))\\land t_D(F_1(f))=F_0(t_C(f))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in C_0\\;F_1(e_C(a))=e_D(F_0(a))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,g\\in C_1\\;\\bigl(t_C(f)=s_C(g)\\to\nF_1(c_C(\\langle g,f\\rangle))=c_D(\\langle F_1(g),F_1(f)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}functor}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C,D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D,F_0,F_1\\;\\bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal D)\n\\land F_0\\in D_0^{C_0}\\land F_1\\in D_1^{C_1}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\bigl(s_D(F_1(f))=F_0(s_C(f))\\land t_D(F_1(f))=F_0(t_C(f))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in C_0\\;F_1(e_C(a))=e_D(F_0(a))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,g\\in C_1\\;\\bigl(t_C(f)=s_C(g)\\to\nF_1(c_C(\\langle g,f\\rangle))=c_D(\\langle F_1(g),F_1(f)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对象映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0\">\\(F_0\\)</span> 与箭头映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_1\">\\(F_1\\)</span> 被显式区分，并分别约束源、靶、单位与复合。</li>\n<li>Covariant: preserves direction of morphisms</li>\n<li>Contravariant: reverses direction (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(f^{\\mathrm{op}}) = F(f)^{\\mathrm{op}}\">\\(F(f^{\\mathrm{op}}) = F(f)^{\\mathrm{op}}\\)</span>)</li>\n<li>Representable: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F \\cong \\mathcal{C}(X, -)\">\\(F \\cong \\mathcal{C}(X, -)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mac Lane, Categories for the Working Mathematician</li>\n<li>Awodey, Category Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-category-theory","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-category-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category-theory","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}$ 取 [[58-df-category-theory]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}functor}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C,D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D,F_0,F_1\\;\\bigl[\\\\\n&\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal D)\n\\land F_0\\in D_0^{C_0}\\land F_1\\in D_1^{C_1}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\bigl(s_D(F_1(f))=F_0(s_C(f))\\land t_D(F_1(f))=F_0(t_C(f))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in C_0\\;F_1(e_C(a))=e_D(F_0(a))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f,g\\in C_1\\;\\bigl(t_C(f)=s_C(g)\\to\nF_1(c_C(\\langle g,f\\rangle))=c_D(\\langle F_1(g),F_1(f)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"F_0","display":false},{"tex":"F_1","display":false},{"tex":"F(f^{\\mathrm{op}}) = F(f)^{\\mathrm{op}}","display":false},{"tex":"F \\cong \\mathcal{C}(X, -)","display":false}],"bytes":1888,"backlinks":[{"id":"ff4636701b68a3a3","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S$ (functor predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]])"},{"id":"b3c68757beeea68b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4b4cc773d6acdba5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-functor]])"},{"id":"8d3eef48d90e1884","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]])"},{"id":"cbc1735835617989","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e56495c9794b9dd7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S$ (functor predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]])"},{"id":"9a02fd87820572ba","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S$ (functor predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]])"},{"id":"4ea8fe70b7dab958","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S$ (functor predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]])"},{"id":"970e2b8779070da0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6a9264f67286f4b8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6c166bd3b5abb270","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6eedc7cef16ac70e","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Functor}$ 取 [[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"5caf5b54bcc1111e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dfa5042443233c40","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1f5113ef45d8213e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7200e183a0335a63","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S$ (functor predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]])"},{"id":"50b20f786d960883","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Functor}$ 取 [[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"7b1e5646c6075a74","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S$ (functor predicate, see [[58-df-functor]])"},{"id":"02265763bed70209","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S$ (functor predicate, see [[58-df-functor]])"},{"id":"61daa6066fb2ea14","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S$ (functor predicate, see [[58-df-functor]])"},{"id":"5d5e197234e9b36c","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Functor}$ 取 [[5